1️⃣ TASARIM ÖZETİ (NET)
Roller

Spine: Route-reflector + underlay

Leaf1 / Leaf2: VTEP + Gateway

Underlay (L3)

Spine ↔ Leaf1 : 10.0.0.0/30

Spine ↔ Leaf2 : 20.0.0.0/30

IGP: OSPF (örnek)

Loopback’ler
Cihaz	Lo0 (BGP RID)	Lo1 (VTEP)
Spine	1.1.1.9	1.1.1.1
Leaf1	2.2.2.9	2.2.2.2
Leaf2	3.3.3.9	3.3.3.3
Overlay

VRF: vpn-default

L2 VNIs

VLAN 10 → VNI 10 → 192.168.10.0/24

VLAN 20 → VNI 20 → 192.168.20.0/24

L3 VNI: 1000

Anycast GW

VLAN10 GW → 192.168.10.1

VLAN20 GW → 192.168.20.1

2️⃣ SPINE KONFİGÜRASYONU
system-view
hostname SPINE

interface loopback 0
 ip address 1.1.1.9/32

interface loopback 1
 ip address 1.1.1.1/32

interface gigabitEthernet 1/0/1
 ip address 10.0.0.1/30

interface gigabitEthernet 1/0/2
 ip address 20.0.0.1/30

ospf 1
 area 0
  network 1.1.1.9 0.0.0.0
  network 1.1.1.1 0.0.0.0
  network 10.0.0.0 0.0.0.3
  network 20.0.0.0 0.0.0.3

router bgp 65000
 router-id 1.1.1.9
 peer 2.2.2.9 remote-as 65000
 peer 3.3.3.9 remote-as 65000

 address-family l2vpn evpn
  peer 2.2.2.9 enable
  peer 3.3.3.9 enable


📌 Spine VTEP değildir, VXLAN config yok.

3️⃣ LEAF1 KONFİGÜRASYONU
system-view
hostname LEAF1

interface loopback 0
 ip address 2.2.2.9/32

interface loopback 1
 ip address 2.2.2.2/32

interface gigabitEthernet 1/0/1
 ip address 10.0.0.2/30

ospf 1
 area 0
  network 2.2.2.9 0.0.0.0
  network 2.2.2.2 0.0.0.0
  network 10.0.0.0 0.0.0.3

fabric anycast-gateway-mac 0000.1111.2222

vtep
 source loopback 1
 arp suppress enable

ip vrf vpn-default
 rd 100:100
 route-target export 1000:1000
 route-target import 1000:1000

interface overlayrouter 10
 ip vrf binding vpn-default
 ip address 192.168.10.1/24
 anycast-gateway

interface overlayrouter 20
 ip vrf binding vpn-default
 ip address 192.168.20.1/24
 anycast-gateway

interface overlayrouter 1000
 ip vrf binding vpn-default

vxlan 10
 vni 10
 extend-vlan 10
 router-interface overlayrouter 10
 arp suppress enable

vxlan 20
 vni 20
 extend-vlan 20
 router-interface overlayrouter 20
 arp suppress enable

vxlan 1000
 vni 1000
 symmetric
 router-interface overlayrouter 1000

router bgp 65000
 router-id 2.2.2.9
 peer 1.1.1.9 remote-as 65000
 peer 1.1.1.9 update-source loopback 0

 address-family l2vpn evpn
  peer 1.1.1.9 enable
  advertise ipv4 unicast-af-modifier

 address-family ipv4 vrf vpn-default
  redistribute connected

evpn
 vni 10
  rd auto
  route-target both auto
 vni 20
  rd auto
  route-target both auto
 vni 1000
  rd auto
  route-target both auto

