5️⃣ EN KRİTİK 3 KURAL (AKLINDA KALSIN)

1️⃣ VLAN = L2 VNI

VLAN 10 → VNI 10
VLAN 20 → VNI 20


2️⃣ VRF = L3 VNI

vpn-default → VNI 1000


3️⃣ Gateway IP overlayrouter’da verilir

192.168.10.1 → overlayrouter 10
192.168.20.1 → overlayrouter 20
